<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept jobless rate unchanged at 3.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept jobless rate unchanged at 3.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's seasonally adjusted unemployment rate in September was unchanged from August at 3.3 percent, while the closely watched jobs-to-applicants ratio was also steady at 0.71 in September, the government announced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A breakdown of the jobs data follows:</p>
<p>    (Adjusted)			Sept	August     Year ago</p>
<p>    Unemployment rate	     3.3 pct   3.3 pct    3.2 pct</p>
<p>					  Sept	August     Year ago</p>
<p>    Jobs-to-applicants ratio    0.71	0.71	 0.61</p>
<p> (Unadjusted)		    Sept	August     Year ago</p>
<p> Unemployment rate	     3.3 pct   3.3 pct     3.2 pct</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	  2.24 million  2.24 million   2.19 million</p>
<p> Number of employed		  September     Year/year change</p>
<p> Overall				 65.69 million    +0.6 pct</p>
<p> Main Industries:</p>
<p>  Manufacturing			14.87 million    +0.7 pct</p>
<p>  Services			     15.96 million    -0.1 pct</p>
<p>  Wholesale, retail, restaurants 14.66 million    +1.6 pct</p>
<p>  Construction			  6.70 million    +2.3 pct</p>
<p>  Agriculture			   3.84 million    +0.3 pct</p>
</text>
